<title>JAPAN: GOLF-UNITED STATES BEAT JAPAN IN NICHIREI WOMEN'S MATCH.</title>
<headline>GOLF-UNITED STATES BEAT JAPAN IN NICHIREI WOMEN'S MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States beat Japan</p>
<p>21-1/2-14-1/2 in the $675,000 Nichirei women's match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Japanese names first):</p>
<p> Toshimi Kimura	75	 Barb Mucha	 71</p>
<p> Marnie McGuire	74	 Joan Pitcock     71</p>
<p> Aki Nakano	    74	 Pat Hurst	  74</p>
<p> Yukiyo Haga	   75	 Brandie Burton   68</p>
<p> Suzuko Maeda	  74	 Julie Piers	73</p>
<p> Miyuki Shimabukuro  76	 Marianne Morris  76</p>
<p> Mayumi Murai	  76	 Barb Whitehead   72</p>
<p> Akane Oshiro	  81	 Val Skinner	74</p>
<p> Ikuyo Shiotani	71	 Emilee Klein     71</p>
<p> Aki Takamura	  71	 Lise Neumann     72</p>
<p> Michiko Hattori     71	 Penny Hammel     73</p>
<p> Kaori Higo	    71	 Kris Tschetter   72</p>
<p> Natsuko Noro	  73	 Chris Johnson    73</p>
<p> Aiko Hashimoto	68	 Jane Geddes	73</p>
<p> Kaori Harada	  75	 Tracy Kerdyk     74</p>
<p> Akiko Fukushima     71	 Hiromi Kobayashi 72</p>
<p> Ku Ok-hee	     70	 Michelle McGann  77</p>
<p> Ayako Okamoto	 73	 Karrie Webb	68</p>
